Scope

This pack contains: the SpEdE Local ComfyUI custom nodes (nodes.py), the
spede_core engine, the SpEdE web UI (studio/), the geometry helpers
(geometry_cli.py), the Comfy SDK v2 runner (local_sdk.py), the ComfyUI
workflow graphs (workflows/), the GPU smoke script, the tests and the
examples (the fixture generator and example outputs). Model weights and
scenes are NOT included.

